00:14:07,000 --> 00:14:09,000
Thinking about it, it's really a kind of a poor use of resources

310
00:14:09,000 --> 00:14:11,000
for you to have 20 scouts

311
00:14:11,000 --> 00:14:13,000
and the other troop to have 40 scouts.

