00:14:39,000 --> 00:14:41,000
some kind of popularity contest.

326
00:14:41,000 --> 00:14:43,000
So would you appreciate it if I made those changes?

327
00:14:43,000 --> 00:14:45,000
Of course not,

328
00:14:45,000 --> 00:14:47,000
Even though they make perfect sense on paper.

329
00:14:47,000 --> 00:14:49,000
I'm taking away your friends, I'm breaking up your team,

330
00:14:49,000 --> 00:14:51,000
I'm telling your scouts

331
00:14:51,000 --> 00:14:53,000
who they ought to be going scouting with.

332
00:14:53,000 --> 00:14:55,000
When we fix patrols,

333
00:14:55,000 --> 00:14:57,000
when we try to even out numbers

334
00:14:57,000 --> 00:14:59,000
and ranks and ages and experience,

335
00:14:59,000 --> 00:15:01,000
we're usually breaking up friends and teams.

336
00:15:01,000 --> 00:15:03,000
Scouts find this just as disheartening

337
00:15:03,000 --> 00:15:05,000
as you or I would

