00:15:07,000 --> 00:15:09,000
I imagined just a moment ago.

340
00:15:09,000 --> 00:15:11,000
Scouts really ought to be able

341
00:15:11,000 --> 00:15:13,000
to choose their own patrols.

342
00:15:13,000 --> 00:15:15,000
Let me give you an example of why that works.

343
00:15:15,000 --> 00:15:17,000
About a year ago, when something went wrong

344
00:15:17,000 --> 00:15:19,000
