350
00:15:29,000 --> 00:15:31,000
but it didn't work.

351
00:15:31,000 --> 00:15:33,000
No matter what patrol they were in,

352
00:15:33,000 --> 00:15:35,000
the terrible trio were fast friends

353
00:15:35,000 --> 00:15:37,000
and they gravitated to each other

354
00:15:37,000 --> 00:15:39,000
at meetings and at outings.

355
00:15:39,000 --> 00:15:41,000
This kind of thing caused their patrol leaders

356
00:15:41,000 --> 00:15:43,000
