00:21:10,000 --> 00:21:12,000
you're going to pretty much have to

521
00:21:12,000 --> 00:21:14,000
accept the answer

522
00:21:14,000 --> 00:21:16,000
or change troops.

523
00:21:16,000 --> 00:21:18,000
if you keep hammering away at it,

524
00:21:18,000 --> 00:21:20,000
you're going to be branded a troublemaker

525
00:21:20,000 --> 00:21:22,000
and that's going to affect your son.

526
00:21:22,000 --> 00:21:24,000
you know, sometimes we change jobs

527
00:21:24,000 --> 00:21:26,000
and friends and churches

528
00:21:26,000 --> 00:21:28,000
and even spouses, I mean-

529
00:21:28,000 --> 00:21:30,000
until we find the right fit.

