00:21:30,000 --> 00:21:32,000
scouting is kind of the same way.

531
00:21:32,000 --> 00:21:34,000
we calculate the losses and benefits

532
00:21:34,000 --> 00:21:36,000
of the change that we make

533
00:21:36,000 --> 00:21:38,000
and we may conclude that we're better off accepting

534
00:21:38,000 --> 00:21:40,000
things that rankle us

535
00:21:40,000 --> 00:21:42,000
rather than changing our situation.

536
00:21:42,000 --> 00:21:44,000
sometimes we can work

537
00:21:44,000 --> 00:21:46,000
towards making things better,

538
00:21:46,000 --> 00:21:48,000
but it's heavy lifting if you aren't in charge.

539
00:21:48,000 --> 00:21:50,000
in that case, you need a little serenity

540
00:21:50,000 --> 00:21:52,000
to change what you can

541
00:21:52,000 --> 00:21:54,000
and accept what you can.

542
00:21:54,000 --> 00:21:56,000
I hope that helps.

